  "description": "The Luxe Q & QS is a simple yet satisfying device that offers long battery life in a super-portable, stylish pod kit. These refillable pods come pre-installed with either a 0.8ohm mesh coil for a slightly airier, restricted DL (direct lung) sensation, or a 1.0ohm coil for an intense and flavoursome MTL (mouth-to-lung) sensation. Both the pods and coils deliver immaculate flavour and when it’s time to refill, the leakproof SSS technology and top-filling port ensures mess-free top-ups. When the coil reaches the end of its life you simply replace the whole pod. Ideal for use with Classic/High PG , 50/50 , Nicotine Salts e-liquids . Please Note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
